            "text/html": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert\"><h2 id=\"configuration-and-setup\">Configuration and Setup</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This section establishes the computational environment with reproducible random seeds,\noptimization parameters, and file paths for the analysis pipeline.</span></span>"
